            <title>[LU-20988] lfs find --foreign gives the wrong answer for foreign and striped directories</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20988</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Component: utils (lfs, liblustreapi)&lt;br/&gt;
Affects: 2.14.53 and later, master (ee61b3f6dd)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;find_check_foreign()&lt;/tt&gt; in &lt;tt&gt;lustre/utils/liblustreapi_pfind.c&lt;/tt&gt; tests a directory's LMV the wrong way round. A foreign directory is taken as not foreign, and a striped directory (whose LMV is not foreign) is taken as foreign. So &lt;tt&gt;lfs find --foreign&lt;/tt&gt; skips foreign directories and prints striped ones, and &lt;tt&gt;lfs find ! --foreign&lt;/tt&gt; does the opposite. Plain directories have no LMV and are decided earlier, so they come out right, which is likely why this was not seen. No test runs &lt;tt&gt;lfs find --foreign&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The negation was lost in baba1fd07a ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-14489" title="&amp;quot;lfs find --mdt-count +1&amp;quot; fails with &amp;quot;Operation not permitted&amp;quot;" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-14489"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-14489&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; utils: fix 'lfs find --mdt-count'"), which changed&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;if (lfm-&amp;gt;lfm_magic != LMV_MAGIC_FOREIGN) {
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;if (lmv_is_foreign(lfm-&amp;gt;lfm_magic)) {
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The regular-file branch just above still has &lt;tt&gt;!= LOV_USER_MAGIC_FOREIGN&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer (2 MDTs):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs mkdir -i 0 /mnt/lustre/fr
lfs mkdir --foreign=none --xattr=$(uuidgen) --flags=0xda05 /mnt/lustre/fr/fdir
lfs setstripe --foreign=none --xattr=$(uuidgen) --flags=0xda05 /mnt/lustre/fr/ffile
lfs mkdir -c 2 /mnt/lustre/fr/sdir
mkdir /mnt/lustre/fr/dir; touch /mnt/lustre/fr/file /mnt/lustre/fr/sdir/f
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Stock master:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs find fr --foreign                  -&amp;gt;  ffile sdir
lfs find fr ! --foreign                -&amp;gt;  . dir fdir file sdir/f
lfs find fr --foreign=none -type d     -&amp;gt;  sdir
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expected (with the fix):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;lfs find fr --foreign                  -&amp;gt;  fdir ffile
lfs find fr ! --foreign                -&amp;gt;  . dir file sdir sdir/f
lfs find fr --foreign=none -type d     -&amp;gt;  fdir
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The fix restores the negation, &lt;tt&gt;!lmv_is_foreign(lfm-&amp;gt;lfm_magic)&lt;/tt&gt;, and adds sanity &lt;tt&gt;test_27Kf&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
